      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 7: Screening for TB using molecular WHO-recommended rapid diagnostic",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.2064208984375,
        271.5292053222656,
        353.6274108886719
      ],
      "text": "tests among medical inpatients with HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.3824157714844,
        527.4293823242188,
        367.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "TB is the main cause of hospitalization and mortality among people living with HIV  . Given the  (12)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.3824157714844,
        527.3927612304688,
        381.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "high mortality among people living with HIV who are medical in-patients in TB high burden settings,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        381.3824157714844,
        527.4487915039062,
        395.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "WHO strongly recommends the use of mWRDs for rapid work-up in this population, regardless of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        395.3824157714844,
        527.3848266601562,
        409.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "symptoms. The assessment of the performance of an mWRD used as a combined TB screening and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        409.3824157714844,
        527.4201049804688,
        423.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "diagnostic strategy for medical ward patients with HIV included four studies in Ghana, Myanmar and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        423.3824157714844,
        527.39599609375,
        437.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "South Africa with a total of 639 participants. The prevalence of TB in the included studies was 23.8%,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.3824157714844,
        524.3908081054688,
        451.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "ranging from 7% to 26%. The mWRD test assessed in the IPD was primarily the Xpert MTB/RIF assay.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        465.3824157714844,
        527.4244995117188,
        479.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "Using the W4SS alone had 96% sensitivity and 11% specificity in the IPD meta-analysis of medical",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        479.3824157714844,
        527.400390625,
        493.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "ward inpatients living with HIV, 94% of whom were positive on the W4SS. Thus, the difference in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.3824157714844,
        527.4486694335938,
        507.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "accuracy was minimal between the full screening and diagnostic strategy of using W4SS followed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.3824462890625,
        527.4376831054688,
        521.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "by mWRD, and using mWRD alone. Therefore, the value of the W4SS was judged to have limited",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.3824462890625,
        527.4476928710938,
        535.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "utility in screening for TB in this population prior to an mWRD test, and the GDG recommended that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        535.3824462890625,
        527.4134521484375,
        549.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "medical inpatients should be screened and tested with an mWRD, irrespective of symptoms, to inform",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        549.3824462890625,
        527.4376220703125,
        563.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "a decision about whether to treat for TB. A 10% threshold TB prevalence among hospital inpatients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.3824462890625,
        527.4573974609375,
        577.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "living with HIV is recommended, taking into account the TB prevalence among the participants",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.3823852539062,
        527.3970336914062,
        591.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "studied and striking a balance between ensuring rapid diagnosis in this critically ill population",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.3823852539062,
        527.3904418945312,
        605.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "and the need to avoid overtreatment. In lower prevalence settings, a screening and diagnostic",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.3823852539062,
        527.4531860351562,
        619.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "strategy with mWRD alone would give rise to higher numbers of false positives, with overtreatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        619.3823852539062,
        527.4345703125,
        633.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "and the related social and economic consequences, including potential delay in starting ART. This",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        633.3823852539062,
        485.86322021484375,
        647.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "recommendation may not be applicable to settings with a lower pre-test probability of TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        329.7992858886719,
        801.2599487304688,
        553.4072875976562,
        811.8897705078125
      ],
      "text": "13 2. ﻿ Reduce the burden of TB among people living with HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
